// SP7 M2 Task 3: `strata update` — the program half (fetch, verify, confirm,
// install, atomic current flip, rollback). GENERATED by the lane ledger's
// fixture generator (gen_update_test.py from update_fixtures.json): envelopes
// are RFC 8032 section-6 reference signatures, never hand-transcribed (R-T0-b).
// Layout rulings: R-T3-a (mirror base URL + /envelope + /<file>), R-T3-h
// (components under <version>/bin/), R-T3-i (staging cleaned on failure).
